{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2382450/extras/e088fa6fc78290a39e71ea34c9d59570.poster.avif?t=1769990516\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2382450/extras/e088fa6fc78290a39e71ea34c9d59570.webm?t=1769990516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2382450/extras/e088fa6fc78290a39e71ea34c9d59570.mp4?t=1769990516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a brand new ship with limited weapons and upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot down Asteroids and Enemy ships for resources (Iron, Gold, Platinum, Obsidian). </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use these resources to purchase new upgrades like ship enhancements and new weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your progress will persist and each play session will have you becoming stronger and being able to last longer in the game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2382450/extras/b3a47c0bbc815060d7386f84919cf80a.poster.avif?t=1769990516\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2382450/extras/b3a47c0bbc815060d7386f84919cf80a.webm?t=1769990516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2382450/extras/b3a47c0bbc815060d7386f84919cf80a.mp4?t=1769990516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Modes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic</strong> - A retro style game mode featuring more classic style endless gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade</strong> - A more arcadey experience where randomized upgrades will appear as physical objects for you to acquire and equip. Each game session will be different from the last leading to endless replayability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaos Agent</strong> - Take on a horde of endless enemies in this boss rush style gameplay. How long can you last before being overrun?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cadet</strong> - A spin on the classic gameplay with a more open level approach that has you not only battling against tougher enemies but navigating around dangerous black holes, supernovas, planets and wormholes but also mazes for you to navigate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Galactic Hero</strong> - A tougher version of Cadet that will hit harder but will reward higher resources for your success.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive</strong> - A special game mode where you have limited rockets &amp; no rocket regeneration. Each new level you survive, you will be awarded the choice of a new upgrade to continue.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Void</strong> - Find the special portal to advance to the next level. As you search, take on various hazards of each level.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2382450/extras/3ee378716e726c1c2e3e17b79953fa23.poster.avif?t=1769990516\" width=616 height=110 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2382450/extras/3ee378716e726c1c2e3e17b79953fa23.webm?t=1769990516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2382450/extras/3ee378716e726c1c2e3e17b79953fa23.mp4?t=1769990516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seven Different Arcade / Roguelite Game Modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Wild Open - An exploration sandbox experience to play and mess around in</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ship Upgrades - Upgrade your play style with new weapons and enhancements over time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local Co-Op / Versus Modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online Co-Op / Versus Modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alternate Visual Mode to Unlock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music Mode</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Space: The Final Frontier","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2382450/3dd1e1eb19c39790259ebc83c38d8c8a4340433f.jpg"},{"name":"Pilot In Training","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2382450/bc8fb1e72b912c72015a5325b602ede19d97b3d2.jpg"},{"name":"Space Commander","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2382450/81585386114fb622baba1e571e73ac796acb070d.jpg"},{"name":"How Do You Like Them Rockets?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2382450/a5cc97eaeddeec1816a60ab3ae5c875626dbc304.jpg"},{"name":"Master Of All","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2382450/3dcc76ff07fb96f2dc238b368b14f67a22aa0cdf.jpg"},{"name":"Ready? Set? Go!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2382450/e21a8c8d1bb0e45df61100fcaf279bcf5505838d.jpg"},{"name":"Fair Trade","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/23